         <description><![CDATA[<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/cb29f784-27c0-40a1-a21e-5ac05b3466d3,1794922724377/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C0%2C6144%2C3456%29%3B' alt='An aerial (drone) shot shows Toronto City Hall at sunset and twilight.' width='620' height='349' title='Aerial (drone) images of Toronto City Hall at sunset and twilight.'/><p>Toronto's mayor and 25 councillors will take part in their first council meeting Wednesday, where they will swear an oath of office and Olivia Chow will make her first speech. There are seven new faces on the council floor this term.</p>]]></description>
